config LNET_KFILND
	tristate "Kfabric LND (kkfilnd)"
	depends on LNET
	default n
	help
	  The kfi LND (kkfilnd) carries LNet traffic over kfabric (kernel
	  libfabric) providers, such as the Cray Slingshot CXI network. It
	  requires the out-of-tree kfabric kernel headers.

	  To compile this as a kernel module, choose M here and it will be
	  called kkfilnd.

	  If unsure, say N.
